{
  "file_id": "3615",
  "text_count": 83,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Taichi! Get yourself together!\nHey, Taichi...",
      "_offset": 315,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "A-Agumon... Where are we?",
      "_offset": 361,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I feel like we've been here\nbefore. I definitely feel like\nwe've been here before...",
      "_offset": 387,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Where are the others?",
      "_offset": 472,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "They're not here. Looks like it's\njust us.",
      "_offset": 494,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "No way... We just got back to the\nDigital World from Tokyo...",
      "_offset": 537,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "We'd set up camp and were sleeping\nby the bonfire like we always\ndo...",
      "_offset": 599,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Do you think maybe we're in a\ndream?",
      "_offset": 670,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "A dream? Then why are both of us\nin the same dream?",
      "_offset": 707,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I guess it's not a dream, then.",
      "_offset": 759,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What's that?",
      "_offset": 794,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Someone's coming.",
      "_offset": 807,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Don't move!",
      "_offset": 825,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "It's a Digimon! Who are you?",
      "_offset": 840,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I should be asking *you* that!\nWhat are you doing here?",
      "_offset": 869,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "There's no reason for you to\nsuspect us! We were here before we\nknew it!",
      "_offset": 925,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Really now...?",
      "_offset": 998,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Hey, but you guys look pretty\nstrong!",
      "_offset": 1013,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 1051,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Wanna fight and see who's\nstronger?",
      "_offset": 1056,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Wait, are you talking to me?",
      "_offset": 1092,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 1121,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 1127,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "T-Taichi...",
      "_offset": 1134,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Hey, hey, wait a second! You're\nsaying some weird stuff, you\nknow...",
      "_offset": 1146,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "I'm not a \"you\"! I'm Hackmon!",
      "_offset": 1215,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Uh, Hackmon... why do you want to\nfight Agumon?",
      "_offset": 1245,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Why? Because I'm itchin' to fight\nsomeone strong!",
      "_offset": 1293,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I don't know why I'm here or what\nfor, but...",
      "_offset": 1343,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I just feel like getting in a\nnice, long brawl!",
      "_offset": 1389,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Wait, you were brought here, too?",
      "_offset": 1437,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Yeah! While I was doing my\ntraining off in the mountains...",
      "_offset": 1471,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Someone approached me while I was\ntaking a nap, and before I knew it\nI was here!",
      "_offset": 1531,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I was sleeping, so I didn't get to\nsee them, but I certainly felt\nsomeone's presence!",
      "_offset": 1612,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Someone's presence?",
      "_offset": 1698,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "What's wrong, Agumon?",
      "_offset": 1721,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "I forgot to say this earlier,\nbut...",
      "_offset": 1743,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "I also felt like there was someone\nstanding behind us while we were\nsleeping.",
      "_offset": 1780,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "What?! Why didn't you tell me that\nearlier?",
      "_offset": 1858,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I thought maybe I was just\ndreaming...",
      "_offset": 1902,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Well, that's fair...",
      "_offset": 1941,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "So it seems like you're in my\nboat, then.",
      "_offset": 1962,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Nice to meet you!",
      "_offset": 2004,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I don't wanna hear that! Come on,\nfight me!",
      "_offset": 2022,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Hey... Hey, Taichi...",
      "_offset": 2066,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Hey, why don't we start looking\nfor the exit instead?",
      "_offset": 2088,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah, we've been here\nbefore, so we should be able to\nfind an exit!",
      "_offset": 2142,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Hm...",
      "_offset": 2216,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Aren't there people out there who\nare gonna be worried about you?",
      "_offset": 2222,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Well, I'm sure \"they\" would be\nconcerned about my absence, but...",
      "_offset": 2288,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Are \"they\" your friends?",
      "_offset": 2354,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "They're not my friends! More like\nmy caretakers.",
      "_offset": 2379,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Huh... so you have caretakers?",
      "_offset": 2428,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "You're weird.",
      "_offset": 2459,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Whatever! Let's find a way out of\nhere first.",
      "_offset": 2473,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "...Are we gonna be okay?",
      "_offset": 2519,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "I'm worried, too...",
      "_offset": 2544,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi! You're not a Digimon,\nare you?",
      "_offset": 2564,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Nope! I came to the Digimon world\nfrom another one.",
      "_offset": 2608,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "How'd you get there from another\nworld?",
      "_offset": 2660,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Well, at first we couldn't get\nback to our world at all, and then\na lot of stuff happened...",
      "_offset": 2700,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "So, Hackmon, what kind of stuff do\nyou usually do?",
      "_offset": 2793,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I'm training to become stronger!",
      "_offset": 2844,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Is that it?",
      "_offset": 2877,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Yup! I have a dream, you see.",
      "_offset": 2889,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "What's your dream?",
      "_offset": 2919,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Heh heh heh, that's a secret!",
      "_offset": 2938,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Aw, man.",
      "_offset": 2968,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Ah! There's the exit!",
      "_offset": 2977,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "You're right!",
      "_offset": 2999,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "So I guess we're parting ways,\nhuh?",
      "_offset": 3013,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Hey, Agumon! Can you do me a\nfavor?",
      "_offset": 3049,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 3085,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Next time we meet, fight me!",
      "_offset": 3091,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Huh?! Are you serious?",
      "_offset": 3120,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Of course! I'm gonna be really\nstrong by then!",
      "_offset": 3143,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Hahaha! I knew you'd say that.",
      "_offset": 3190,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi, at least say\nsomething about this...",
      "_offset": 3221,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "See you, Hackmon!",
      "_offset": 3271,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Yeah! Take care, you two!",
      "_offset": 3289,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "【Area 1】",
      "_offset": 3315,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "【Area 2】",
      "_offset": 3338,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "【Area 3】",
      "_offset": 3361,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}